        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;&#39; -------------------- 7. SEQUENCE: UC-02 --------------------\n@startuml Sada_Sequence_UC02\ntitle UC-02 — Submit Sensitive Support Request\nautonumber\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nactor Customer\nboundary \&quot;Customer Web App\&quot; as UI\ncontrol \&quot;Banking API\&quot; as API\ncontrol \&quot;Authentication Service\&quot; as Auth\ncollections \&quot;Evidence Storage\&quot; as Storage\ncontrol \&quot;Sada AI Service\&quot; as AI\ncontrol \&quot;Risk Engine\&quot; as Risk\ndatabase \&quot;Platform Database\&quot; as DB\nCustomer -&gt; UI: Enter request details and attach voice recording\nUI -&gt; API: Submit sensitive support request\nactivate API\nAPI -&gt; Auth: Validate customer session\nactivate Auth\nAuth --&gt; API: Authentication result\ndeactivate Auth\nalt Session invalid\n API --&gt; UI: 401 Unauthorized\nelse Session valid\n API -&gt; API: Validate audio extension, size and header\n alt Audio file invalid\n  API --&gt; UI: 400 Invalid audio file\n else Audio file valid\n  API -&gt; DB: Create SUPPORT_TICKET and AUDIO_FILE metadata\n  DB --&gt; API: ticket_id and audio_id\n  API -&gt; Storage: Store encrypted retained review copy\n  activate Storage\n  Storage --&gt; API: Review storage reference\n  deactivate Storage\n  API -&gt; AI: Request audio assessment\n  activate AI\n  alt AI assessment available\n   AI --&gt; API: Spoof score, quality status and model metadata\n  else AI unavailable\n   AI --&gt; API: Timeout or service unavailable\n  end\n  deactivate AI\n  alt Assessment available\n   API -&gt; Risk: Evaluate banking rules and audio result\n   activate Risk\n   Risk --&gt; API: Risk decision\n   deactivate Risk\n   alt Manual review required\n    API -&gt; DB: Create REVIEW_CASE linked to ticket\n    API -&gt; DB: Set ticket status PENDING_REVIEW\n   else Standard handling\n    API -&gt; DB: Set ticket status SUBMITTED\n   end\n  else Assessment unavailable\n   API -&gt; Risk: Evaluate non-AI banking rules\n   activate Risk\n   Risk --&gt; API: Risk decision\n   deactivate Risk\n   alt Manual review required\n    API -&gt; DB: Create REVIEW_CASE linked to ticket\n    API -&gt; DB: Set ticket status PENDING_REVIEW\n   else Standard handling\n    API -&gt; DB: Set ticket status SUBMITTED\n   end\n  end\n  API -&gt; DB: Append AUDIT_LOG event\n  API --&gt; UI: 201 Created — ticket reference and status\n end\nend\ndeactivate API\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="vPecKsJ7qy07KvzmN1Pw-1">
